        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-20261107-2qs2lbapgi9",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Days 2–3 and 9–10 are outlined as crossings. The Antarctic itinerary covers days 4–7 as a whole. The expedition team decides how to schedule activities across those days."
    },
